            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mermaid"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Quite good. Can be used with any fresh fish. Make sure, however, the fish is absolutely fresh (check for clearness of eyes, for instance). Fresh fish will not taste fishy as someone else noted.\nServe with a jalapeno tartar sauce (mayo, pickle relish [either dill or sweet]and a little diced jalapeno.",
            "datePublished": "2008-10-27T07:32:55.983Z"
          },
          {
